  "limitations": [
    "Ten close paraphrases of precise synthetic task templates; no broad application-goal understanding claim.",
    "Existing training graph families and controls; no untouched held-out accuracy or reliable success-rate estimate.",
    "No weight update; successful replay does not mean the student learned.",
    "Routing candidate labels only; not answer-writing or visualization training data.",
    "Numeric and view/attribute contracts do not establish visual attractiveness or user satisfaction.",
    "Different model identifiers do not establish independent model lineage or error independence.",
    "CLI output-token threshold is post-call acceptance, not a generation or spending cap.",
    "Local evidence and source hashes detect stale/mismatched artifacts, not cryptographically attested provider identity.",
    "Adding the provider changed review-source hashes; previous calibration/review artifacts need fresh runs to qualify new exports."
  ],
